WEBVTT

00:07:29.571 --> 00:07:32.207
and go where people don't often go

00:07:32.207 --> 00:07:34.185
and focus your eyes and your mind

00:07:34.185 --> 00:07:36.402
to recognize the discovery when you see it,

00:07:36.402 --> 00:07:38.733
because it might be in your own backyard.

00:07:38.733 --> 00:07:40.587
Thank you very much.

00:07:40.587 --> 00:07:44.711
(Applause)